    "description": "This Wallpaper is a tribute to Akira Toriyama, thank you very much to him for being able to invent a world as vast and magical as Dragon Ball... RIP Sensei   \r\n\r\nThis Wallpaper was designed to be used on 2 screens! You can display Goku Base Form on the 1st screen and Goku Super Saiyan on the second. I thought about making this Wallpaper with the \"Old School\" design of Dragon Ball with the style of the animated series Dragon Ball Z (by Mr.Minoru Maeda)\r\n\r\nLast note: Remember to disable options that you don't use on Wallpaper Engine! My Wallpapers are very resource intensive, so if you don't use Goku in Super Saiyan, remember to deactivate Destroy Namek\r\n\r\nSongs:\r\n\r\nDragon Ball Z | SSJ Transformation Remake (Mike Smith) | By Gladius: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HqWyL_QDcVA\r\n\r\nDragon Ball Z BGM - A Sigh of Hope (M1020) By Shunsuke Kikuchi: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tGvhc_qxCs\r\n\r\nDragon Ball Z Frieza Theme - Original Soundtrack By Shunsuke Kikuchi: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C5QEw0-J2dA\r\n\r\nDragonball Z Budokai - Namek Theme By Kenji Yamamoto: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QiE6ssOyQPg\r\n\r\nHere I am Burning Now\" from Psychic Force Probably By Hironobu Kageyama: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BMpvqe4Rs-o (Indeed this BGM does not come from Dragon Ball but is perfectly in harmony with the saga)\r\n\r\nTags : \r\n\r\nGoku, Vegeta, Trunks, Son Goten, Bulma, Chichi, Krillin, Android 18, Brown, Videl, Son Gohan, Kaio Shin, Mr.Satan, Majin Buu, Buuhan, Kid Buu, Uub, Super Saiyan, Aura, Vegetto , Vegito, Gogeta, Beerus, Whis, Zeno, Z Team, Fusion, Potaras, Dragon Ball Z, DB, DBZ, SSG, SSGSS, Blue, God, Landscape, God Ki, LR, Legendary Finish, Drama Finish, Final Kamehameha, Anime, Film, Toei Animation, Dragon Ball, Shenron, Wish, Forest, Nature, Wood, 2K, 4K, Angel, Tenshi, Dragon Fist, Nature, Landscape, Power, Strongest",
