  {
    "id": "3174796374",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Memory Lamp",
    "description": "Under this street lamp from my childhood, was where I used to play with my friend. It was our gathering spot before deciding what to play. This is where our meetings started to make serious decisions on the program of the day and time slots of which games to play first.\n\nDuring daytime, it served as one of the side posts for soccer. Usually the second post is a brick that we just randomly place a few feet away from the lamp post. At night, this street lamp was our home base for Hide and Seek. It also was the only place we play marbles under whether it was day or night.\n\nBefore we go home, we meet again under the lamp light at night to discuss what we played, and the fun things that happened. We never scheduled the next day meeting as it was just spontaneous.\n\n\n\nMemory Lamp\n\nOriginal GIF is 320x200px\n40 hand drawn frames\n5 colors",
